    "description": "From December of 1990 to March of 1990, we surveyed the ocean XBT in the cruise of the 6th Antarctic Scientific Expedition of China as a supplement to the krill research programme.The levels include:0,10,20,30,50,75,100,125,150,200,250,300,400 and 500m. BMT is Beijing Mean Time.This data set  include:date(BMT),latitude,longitude,temperature-at-indicated-depth(Degree Celsius).",
